sentences.t:
Praeterea, si nona diem mortalibus almum
Aurora extulerit radiisque retexerit orbem,
prima citae Teucris ponam certamina classis;

sentences.l:
Besides, if the ninth, the day to mortals kindly,
Aurora shall have brought forth and with her rays shall have unveiled the world,
first for the Teucrians I will set contests of a swift fleet;
